      One string per language rather than a string-array, because an array is
      index-keyed and index drift against Languages.CATALOG is exactly the
      invisible coupling this refactor removes. Cost: two lines per new language.

      These are display names and are deliberately not Language.englishName, which
      the server prompt uses and which wants the precise form ("Modern Standard
      Arabic", "Mandarin Chinese"). A list of courses wants the short one.
